            "review_title": "Review at Eden Home",
            "review_text": "Happiness14956988770\n9 contributions\n0\nA Wonderful Stay at Eden Home\nMar 2026 • Family\nWe had a truly wonderful experience at Eden Home. The rooms are beautiful and decorated with unique patterns. What makes this place special is that every room has its own style and design, so no two rooms are the same. It creates a sense of excitement and curiosity when exploring each space.\n\nBesides the comfortable accommodation, we were also pleasantly surprised by the food here. In addition to the fresh seafood available around the area, Eden Home also serves many familiar dishes such as French fries, fried chicken, hamburgers, rice dishes, pasta, and pizza. The food and drinks were all delicious and thoughtfully prepared.\n\nEden Home offers full amenities and a very comfortable atmosphere. It is definitely a place worth staying at, and we highly recommend it to anyone visiting this area.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nMy favorite is the Beef Hamburger—so good! I’ve tried many burgers, but this one stands out. Herb Beef Rice is also amazing. Highly recommen\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 13, 2026",
